doc:sec-6-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "6(3) Functions of Bureau" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subject to subsection (4), each new proposal for the collection of information for statistical purposes by the Bureau shall be laid before both Houses of the Parliament before its implementation, unless the proposal is for the collection of information on a voluntary basis." ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-6-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6(4) Functions of Bureau"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-6-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Where, in relation to a proposal to which subsection (3) is applicable, being a proposal for the collection of information relating to businesses, the Minister considers it necessary to commence implementation of the proposal at a time when it is not practicable to comply with subsection (3) the Minister may authorize the implementation of the proposal without compliance with that subsection but in such a case particulars of the nature of the information to which the authorization relates shall be laid before each House of the Parliament within 5 sitting days of that House after the giving of the authorization." ;
    skos:definition "(4) Where, in relation to a proposal to which subsection (3) is applicable, being a proposal for the collection of information relating to businesses, the Minister considers it necessary to commence implementation of the proposal at a time when it is not practicable to comply with subsection (3) the Minister may authorize the implementation of the proposal without compliance with that subsection but in such a case particulars of the nature of the information to which the authorization relates shall be laid before each House of the Parliament within 5 sitting days of that House after the giving of the authorization."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a138e46bd75822b60a842c3a730db9714199e8da4b3bc3dee21a776366bfc91c" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-6 ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Conditional commencement of proposal implementation without compliance with subsection (3)" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975.pdf, p.8" ;
    cml:asserts concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-6-ss-4-norm .
