concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-16a-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16A(3) Persons seconded to the Bureau"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-16a-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subsection (1) has effect in addition to, and not in substitution for, a provision of the Public Service Act 1999 that provides for the making of arrangements under which a person performs services in the Bureau. Note: Persons whose services are made available in accordance with arrangements made under the Public Service Act 1999 are covered by subsection 16(1) of this Act." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Subsection (1) has effect in addition to, and not in substitution for, a provision of the Public Service Act 1999 that provides for the making of arrangements under which a person performs services in the Bureau. Note: Persons whose services are made available in accordance with arrangements made under the Public Service Act 1999 are covered by subsection 16(1) of this Act."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a8c61003cfc94a931034242d2db86c36f898f8e5ef20dafecd6e497529bf16dc" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-16a ;
    cof:pageNumber "13"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Persons seconded to the Bureau must comply with subsection (1) in addition to arrangements made under the Public Service Act 1999." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
