doc:sec-19-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "19(1) Membership of Council" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Council shall consist of:  (a) the Chairperson;  (b) the Statistician; and  (c) such other members, being not less than 10 and not more than 22 in number, as the Minister determines." ;
    cof:pageNumber "14"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-19-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "19(2) Membership of Council"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-19-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Chairperson and the members referred to in paragraph (1)(c) shall be appointed by the Minister as part-time members, and shall hold office, subject to this Act:  (a) in the case of the Chairperson—for a period of 5 years; and   Australian Statistics Advisory Council  Part III  Section 20  Australian Bureau of Statistics Act 1975 Compilation date: 3/5/19 Registered: 10/5/19  (b) in the case of each other member—for such period, not exceeding 3 years, as is specified in his or her instrument of appointment; but are eligible for re-appointment." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The Chairperson and the members referred to in paragraph (1)(c) shall be appointed by the Minister as part-time members, and shall hold office, subject to this Act:  (a) in the case of the Chairperson—for a period of 5 years; and   Australian Statistics Advisory Council  Part III  Section 20  Australian Bureau of Statistics Act 1975 Compilation date: 3/5/19 Registered: 10/5/19  (b) in the case of each other member—for such period, not exceeding 3 years, as is specified in his or her instrument of appointment; but are eligible for re-appointment."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "eea650c4b77de82ba7241f099674ae1ba6634eb1b6c8e150ee96a37e80aef2ce" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-19 ;
    cof:pageNumber "14"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Members must be appointed by the Minister for a specified period." ;
