    cof:title "19(2) Membership of Council" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Chairperson and the members referred to in paragraph (1)(c) shall be appointed by the Minister as part-time members, and shall hold office, subject to this Act:  (a) in the case of the Chairperson—for a period of 5 years; and   Australian Statistics Advisory Council  Part III  Section 20  Australian Bureau of Statistics Act 1975 Compilation date: 3/5/19 Registered: 10/5/19  (b) in the case of each other member—for such period, not exceeding 3 years, as is specified in his or her instrument of appointment; but are eligible for re-appointment." ;
