concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-20 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20 Resignation and removal of members"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-20 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A member may resign his or her office by writing signed by the member and delivered to the Minister.  (2) The Minister may remove a member from office for misbehaviour or physical or mental incapacity." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A member may resign his or her office by writing signed by the member and delivered to the Minister.  (2) The Minister may remove a member from office for misbehaviour or physical or mental incapacity."@en ;
